  ▌ sshpick list [query ...] [options]

  List the hosts that match a query.

  Options:

       --json  Output as JSON


  Global Options:

  -h,  --help             Output usage information
       --no-color         No color mode (default off)
       --non-interactive  Never open the picker; connect only when exactly one
                          host matches
  -V,  --version          Output the version number


  Examples:

  - List every host

    $ sshpick list

  - List the hosts matching both words

    $ sshpick list new consul

  - Pipe the host table to another tool

    $ sshpick ls | fzf

  - Print only the host names

    $ sshpick ls | cut -f2

  - List the hosts as JSON

    $ sshpick list --json
